Package: CKMAIcalc
Title: Compute the CKMAI Score
Version: 1.0.1
Authors@R: person("Zhengyang", "Zhu", email = "1149221197@qq.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides functions to compute the Composite Kidney-Metabolic-Aging Index (CKMAI) based on 18 variables with automatic dummy variable handling. Version 1.0.1 harmonizes the Sex coding across the three serialized models and uses the signed (direction-preserving) coefficient weights as the published index.
License: GPL-3
Depends: R (>= 3.5.0)
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: false
Imports:
